Cargo: How much cargo the vehicle
can carry, in tons.
Hull: A measure of how much damage
the vehicle can sustain before it is
destroyed or rendered inoperable.

Cost: How much it costs to purchase
the vehicle.

vehicles

Shipping: How much space the vehicle
will require for transport on a spacecraft.

Armour: Similar to the armour worn
by Travellers, this is how well the
vehicle can resist damage.


